	(text "USB-C board\nReceptacle, 5.1k on CC1 and CC2 separately (5 V sink), USBLC6-2SC6 next to the receptacle.\nJ701 to the main board's J_USB (XH 4: VBUS, D-, D+, GND). Cable <= 15 cm for USB full speed.\nFit this board or USB301 on the main board, not both."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
